{
  "uid": "motor-fraude",
  "title": "Motor de fraude",
  "tags": ["motor-fraude"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Motor de fraude",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Painéis entram junto com cada serviço (specs 001–006). Já disponível: **Receiver** (spec 001) e **Gestão de regras** (spec 002). Ainda por vir: p99 fim a fim do motor, alertas por severidade, lag de consumo, entregas por canal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Receiver (spec 001)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisições por segundo, por desfecho",
      "description": "ACCEPTED e DUPLICATE respondem 202. IN_FLIGHT e UNAVAILABLE respondem 503, RATE_LIMITED 429, REJECTED 400, UNAUTHORIZED 401, TOO_LARGE 413.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(receiver_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p99 da publicação no Kafka (até o ack)",
      "description": "Principal componente da latência do receiver. Meta do SC-001: p99 do receiver até 30 ms.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.03 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(receiver_publish_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(receiver_publish_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duplicatas barradas e reenvios em andamento (por segundo)",
      "description": "DUPLICATE: reenvio depois do ack do Kafka. IN_FLIGHT: reenvio enquanto a primeira ainda publicava.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_duplicates_blocked_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "duplicatas barradas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_in_flight_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "em andamento"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fail-open do Redis, por motivo (por segundo)",
      "description": "Redis lento (timeout de 5 ms) ou fora do ar: o receiver segue sem o escudo e o motor resolve a duplicata. Falhas de confirm e release também aparecem aqui.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(receiver_redis_failopen_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "fail-open: {{reason}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_redis_confirm_failures_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falha no confirm"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(receiver_redis_release_failures_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falha no release"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Gestão de regras (spec 002)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conjuntos publicados, por ação (últimos 5 min)",
      "description": "Cada ativação, sombra, desligamento, rollback ou mudança de scoring publica um conjunto novo. Aparece em zero desde a partida do serviço.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (action) (increase(rules_published_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas de compilação (últimos 5 min)",
      "description": "rule: a expressão de uma regra nova ou de uma nova versão não compilou (422 na criação). rule-set: o conjunto resultante não compilou e nada foi publicado.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(rules_compilation_failures_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GET /v1/rule-sets/active: p50 e p99, por status",
      "description": "O que o motor consulta a cada 30 s, já com a autenticação. 304 = nada mudou. Meta do SC-002: p99 do 304 até 10 ms.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, status) (rate(rule_set_active_request_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, status) (rate(rule_set_active_request_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consultas do motor ao conjunto ativo (por segundo, por status)",
      "description": "Em regime, quase tudo é 304. Um 200 aparece quando uma versão nova é publicada.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(rule_set_active_request_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
